    {
      "ja": "• 積み重ねた技術により少数パーツでありながら抜群の可動！",
      "en": "• Thanks to accumulated technology, it is extremely movable despite having a small number of parts!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• パーツを組み立てるだけで完成！塗装はもちろん、シール貼りも不要！",
      "en": "• Complete by simply assembling the parts! No painting or sealing required!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ニッパーを使わず手でパチパチと簡単に折れるタッチゲート仕様！",
      "en": "• Touch gate design that allows you to easily fold by hand without using nippers!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 部位ごとにまとまったランナー配置！",
      "en": "• Runner arrangement organized by body part!"
    }
